WEBVTT

00:43.043 --> 00:47.965
CHAPTER 19:
YOU JUST HAVE SUCH GOOD CHEMISTRY

00:50.092 --> 00:52.678
EPISODE 6

00:53.721 --> 00:55.514
This can't be real.

00:55.598 --> 00:56.807
It's just a dream.

00:56.891 --> 00:59.310
There's no way this is really happening.

00:59.393 --> 01:00.811
It just can't be.

01:04.565 --> 01:07.234
I just want to die.

01:07.318 --> 01:10.654
Why did it have to be him?

01:10.738 --> 01:12.740
I'm so embarrassed.

01:12.823 --> 01:14.617
This is so humiliating.

01:15.576 --> 01:18.204
Why is he still reading?

01:20.206 --> 01:21.707
Is he enjoying it?

01:23.209 --> 01:24.043
What?

01:24.752 --> 01:25.586
Sorry?

01:26.545 --> 01:27.546
What!

01:37.264 --> 01:40.434
He's supposed to be a genius.
Is he a genius at torture too?

01:40.518 --> 01:43.020
Making me die of humiliation
without a single visible wound?

01:52.196 --> 01:54.031
-Yeo Eui-ju.
-Yes, sir?

01:55.241 --> 01:56.450
What's this?

01:56.534 --> 01:57.368
Sorry, sir?

02:01.789 --> 02:03.040
I asked what this is.

02:08.671 --> 02:09.713
The thing is.

02:10.506 --> 02:13.884
It looks like someone
was working on a web novel.

02:15.344 --> 02:16.887
-Indeed.
-Yes.

02:17.847 --> 02:19.431
Yes, well.

02:19.515 --> 02:22.351
I was pretty surprised myself.

02:22.434 --> 02:24.103
Gosh, that's just nasty…

02:24.979 --> 02:26.063
It's not yours?

02:26.146 --> 02:26.981
No, sir.

02:27.773 --> 02:28.941
I didn't write it.

02:29.024 --> 02:31.485
Like someone who admits to drinking
but denies drunk driving.

02:32.111 --> 02:34.488
You've been caught red-handed,
yet you deny it?

02:38.576 --> 02:41.495
The clueless Korean lit. major Choi Yoon
is Dong-ju.

02:41.579 --> 02:42.997
The complete asshole…

02:46.709 --> 02:48.210
of a math genius Ju Si-on is me.

02:49.253 --> 02:50.838
The dumb sports major Kang Tae-ha,

02:50.921 --> 02:53.424
who solves everything with force,
is Gi-jeon.

02:53.507 --> 02:56.385
And Han Jae-min,
who comes from Japan and is loaded,

02:57.177 --> 02:58.012
is Da-ju.

03:00.055 --> 03:01.974
No.

03:02.057 --> 03:03.976
How did you come to that conclusion?

03:06.312 --> 03:07.980
"I didn't realize
you were such a lost cause."

03:08.063 --> 03:08.898
"I'm very disappointed."

03:08.981 --> 03:10.774
"It was clearly your fault
and you've admitted it."

03:10.858 --> 03:12.359
"All that's left is compensation."

03:12.443 --> 03:14.904
"Breaking my glasses caused
ten million won's worth of damage."

03:14.987 --> 03:16.906
"You'll have to find another way
to repay me."

03:18.824 --> 03:21.702
All that being word for word what I said
is a coincidence?

03:24.914 --> 03:27.291
"You wouldn't let him sleep.
Don't you know he's a sleepyhead?"

03:27.374 --> 03:29.585
Da-ju said that in the car
on the way to school.

03:29.668 --> 03:30.961
Is this all just a coincidence?

03:31.337 --> 03:33.464
Or is my imagination running wild?

03:34.715 --> 03:36.508
You just have such good chemistry.

03:38.761 --> 03:39.678
What?

03:39.762 --> 03:41.305
You all have such good chemistry.

03:41.388 --> 03:43.057
So I just wrote about it.

03:43.140 --> 03:44.058
But the thing is…

03:44.141 --> 03:46.685
People really liked it, so…

03:50.022 --> 03:52.483
Even if you can't tell
right from wrong, still…

03:52.566 --> 03:54.401
There's a line you shouldn't cross.

03:55.527 --> 03:56.612
I'm sorry.

03:57.363 --> 03:58.530
Delete it.

04:00.199 --> 04:01.116
Sorry?

04:02.493 --> 04:03.410
I can't, sir.

04:04.203 --> 04:05.037
You can't?

04:06.914 --> 04:08.040
No, I can't.

04:08.666 --> 04:09.750
I can't.

04:09.833 --> 04:11.168
Please forgive me.

04:11.251 --> 04:12.795
I really can't delete it.

04:12.878 --> 04:15.214
I'm really sorry. It was a mistake,
but I can't delete it.

04:15.798 --> 04:17.424
You base your characters on your teachers

04:17.508 --> 04:20.761
and even have them say things
I can't even bring myself to say.

04:20.844 --> 04:21.971
How can I let that slide?

04:22.054 --> 04:23.430
Put yourself in my position.

04:24.723 --> 04:25.599
Even so.

04:26.809 --> 04:28.060
I can't delete it.

04:28.727 --> 04:29.853
I really can't.

04:31.397 --> 04:32.231
Fine.

04:34.233 --> 04:35.150
Then I will.

04:39.530 --> 04:40.823
PASSWORD

04:45.327 --> 04:46.537
Enter your password.

04:48.580 --> 04:49.540
Mr. Ga.

04:49.623 --> 04:53.168
I'll study really hard.

04:53.252 --> 04:55.838
I'll study math really hard.

04:55.921 --> 04:57.172
Please, give me a break.

04:57.256 --> 04:58.841
Even the dying get one last wish.

04:58.924 --> 05:01.969
Can't you do one favor
to help out a pitiful student?

05:02.052 --> 05:04.346
I put my life and soul into writing it.

05:04.430 --> 05:06.306
How can I just delete it?

05:07.141 --> 05:09.018
Please cut me a break.

05:10.310 --> 05:12.521
I really can't delete it.

05:13.731 --> 05:16.483
I can't delete it.

05:16.984 --> 05:18.485
Please.

05:20.320 --> 05:22.948
What am I going to do?

05:26.201 --> 05:27.494
I'm so sorry.

05:35.210 --> 05:37.087
30 MINUTES LATER

05:51.769 --> 05:52.895
If you really can't delete it,

05:56.565 --> 05:57.900
bring your parents to see me.

05:59.443 --> 06:00.486
-Sorry?
-If you're okay

06:00.569 --> 06:02.071
with your parents, the principal,

06:02.154 --> 06:04.740
the faculty and all the students
knowing what you've been up to.

06:05.365 --> 06:06.617
No, sir.

06:06.700 --> 06:08.077
My mom will kill me.

06:09.495 --> 06:11.538
It seems you know
what you've done is wrong.

06:14.083 --> 06:17.127
Why do you want to keep doing something
you can't tell anyone about?

06:19.505 --> 06:22.382
I'm going to check tomorrow,
so either delete it or bring your parents.

06:24.843 --> 06:26.053
Sir!

06:41.735 --> 06:46.240
CHAPTER 20: THE OBSESSIVE TOP DOESN'T EVEN
HAVE A TOILET IN HIS BATHROOM

06:58.335 --> 07:00.379
I'm home.

07:02.381 --> 07:03.757
I made galbijjim.

07:05.509 --> 07:06.760
I'm not hungry.

07:08.220 --> 07:10.472
What's wrong? Are you sick?

07:11.598 --> 07:12.516
No.

07:13.684 --> 07:16.645
Shall I make you tteokbokki instead?

07:16.728 --> 07:17.980
I'm fine.

07:26.155 --> 07:27.156
Shall I delete it?

07:29.992 --> 07:30.868
No, I can't.

07:32.619 --> 07:34.746
Then everyone will find out what I wrote.

07:34.830 --> 07:38.500
Still, isn't that better than deleting it?

07:39.835 --> 07:42.838
Am I crazy? It's better to delete it.

07:55.267 --> 07:56.768
-You're home?
-Yeah.

07:58.395 --> 08:00.314
-Hey.
-Hey.

08:08.780 --> 08:12.826
Tae-ha caressed Yoon's snow-white skin…

08:15.370 --> 08:16.747
tenderly.

08:20.459 --> 08:22.628
Hey! Sit apart.

08:23.503 --> 08:24.671
I said sit apart.

08:25.464 --> 08:27.049
-What's wrong?
-You startled me.

08:28.467 --> 08:29.343
Wanna play?

08:29.968 --> 08:31.178
No, I can't.

08:31.261 --> 08:33.180
-Just one round.
-No, I need to get to bed.

08:33.263 --> 08:35.015
I know you want to.

08:35.098 --> 08:36.225
Just a quickie.

08:36.808 --> 08:37.935
Wanna

08:38.018 --> 08:41.271
-play?
-Just a quickie.

08:49.655 --> 08:50.781
Let me join in.

08:50.864 --> 08:52.658
-The three of us?
-Move.

08:53.325 --> 08:54.993
Was it leg day today? Nice.

08:56.328 --> 08:57.204
No.

08:57.913 --> 08:59.456
Not two of you, nor three of you.

09:00.123 --> 09:01.375
Just play by yourself.

09:03.669 --> 09:05.128
What do you mean play by ourselves?

09:05.212 --> 09:07.172
What's wrong with you?

09:08.298 --> 09:10.509
You want to play too?
We can change partners.

09:10.592 --> 09:11.885
I'm disgusting.

09:13.011 --> 09:14.471
My mind. My imagination.

09:15.973 --> 09:17.599
What on earth was all that?

09:28.610 --> 09:29.695
BOYS' LOVE

09:29.778 --> 09:32.781
This is for all teachers and students.

09:32.864 --> 09:35.242
Just to inform you
that eleventh-grader Yeo Eui-ju

09:35.325 --> 09:40.872
has been writing a BL web novel
titled We Were Friends.

09:42.416 --> 09:43.750
BL?

09:43.834 --> 09:46.670
You told me you didn't like that.
Were you lying?

09:46.753 --> 09:47.838
Go-ya!

09:47.921 --> 09:49.047
Disgusting.

09:49.631 --> 09:51.591
Pretending to be all sweet and innocent.

09:52.092 --> 09:53.593
Why pair a guy with another guy?

09:54.177 --> 09:55.470
-No.
-Eui-ju.

09:58.515 --> 09:59.391
Mom.

10:00.642 --> 10:01.810
What's wrong?

10:02.394 --> 10:03.228
Mom, I…

10:07.399 --> 10:09.776
This is a crime.

10:09.860 --> 10:12.321
You've tarnished my name and my honor.

10:12.404 --> 10:14.197
I hope you rot in jail.

10:14.281 --> 10:15.574
I made a mistake.

10:16.408 --> 10:17.409
Are you crazy?

10:18.035 --> 10:20.078
Idle hands are the devil's playthings.

10:20.162 --> 10:21.204
It gives me the creeps.

10:21.788 --> 10:22.831
Eui-ju.

10:23.832 --> 10:25.375
No.

10:25.459 --> 10:26.668
No, sir.

10:26.752 --> 10:27.961
It's not like that.

10:33.133 --> 10:34.426
I'm sorry.

10:34.509 --> 10:35.594
I'm sorry.

10:35.677 --> 10:37.971
My daughter didn't do anything wrong.

10:38.597 --> 10:40.766
She learned from me.

10:40.849 --> 10:42.851
-It's all my fault.
-Dad…

10:52.069 --> 10:53.570
No!

10:53.653 --> 10:55.822
What's this?

10:56.948 --> 10:58.283
Let me go!

11:00.744 --> 11:03.288
Don't come any closer.

11:11.755 --> 11:12.714
No.

11:14.007 --> 11:15.092
No.

11:15.175 --> 11:17.219
I must never be outed.

11:18.095 --> 11:20.472
It seems you know
what you've done is wrong.

11:21.139 --> 11:23.809
Why do you want to keep doing something
you can't tell anyone about?

11:29.147 --> 11:30.982
Boys' love…

11:31.066 --> 11:34.986
"The character with the biggest fan base
is the obsessive exhibitionist."

11:35.779 --> 11:39.408
"He lives in a marble penthouse
where the lights are always off."

11:41.701 --> 11:44.663
"He's cut ties with his family
and has no friends."

11:45.580 --> 11:47.833
"When he showers,
he only ever uses the rain shower head."

11:48.750 --> 11:50.627
"In his bathroom, there's…"

11:51.920 --> 11:52.921
NO TOILET

11:53.505 --> 11:54.339
"…no toilet?"

11:57.134 --> 11:57.968
Why not?

12:01.930 --> 12:03.765
Why did I have to get caught

12:03.849 --> 12:06.143
by that asshole of a math teacher?

12:11.606 --> 12:16.570
Ga Woo-su!

12:24.828 --> 12:25.871
Good morning.

12:34.212 --> 12:35.213
Follow me.

12:41.720 --> 12:44.639
COUNSELING IN PROGRESS

12:44.723 --> 12:45.765
Did you delete it?

12:51.771 --> 12:52.939
Mr. Ga.

12:53.440 --> 12:57.444
I started writing web novels
when I was in eighth grade.

13:00.071 --> 13:01.156
And?

13:01.865 --> 13:06.786
It was just a crappy story I made by
cobbling together bits and pieces I liked.

13:07.454 --> 13:11.791
But I decided to upload it
to the Challenge League.

13:11.875 --> 13:13.793
Then, out of the blue, it got

13:13.877 --> 13:14.878
two favorites.

13:14.961 --> 13:18.048
I got so excited that
I did a mass release of two more episodes.

13:20.550 --> 13:22.844
What I mean by that

13:22.928 --> 13:24.763
is in quick succession.

13:24.846 --> 13:28.558
You have to be quick with
the first few episodes to generate

13:28.642 --> 13:29.726
a buzz.

13:29.809 --> 13:32.145
Anyhow, the number of favorites

13:32.229 --> 13:33.688
went straight back down to one.

13:33.772 --> 13:35.398
They must have seen the next two episodes

13:36.608 --> 13:37.442
and done a runner.

13:37.526 --> 13:39.402
10 MINUTES LATER

13:40.403 --> 13:42.822
These days, do you know what I think

13:42.906 --> 13:44.366
when I wake up in the morning?

13:46.243 --> 13:48.370
I can see the light
at the end of the tunnel.

13:48.453 --> 13:52.249
What I thought was a dead-end cave
was actually a tunnel.

13:52.874 --> 13:55.961
The cold and lonely winter

13:57.045 --> 14:00.048
is finally coming to an end
and flowers are going to bloom.

14:01.716 --> 14:05.178
Mr. Ga, this novel

14:05.262 --> 14:08.848
gives me hope
and is a dream I can't give up.

14:08.932 --> 14:11.643
Can you please help me
make my dream come true?

14:11.726 --> 14:13.979
Can you please help me finish my novel?

14:15.188 --> 14:16.022
No.

14:17.023 --> 14:17.941
Just this once.

14:18.024 --> 14:19.526
Just this once, please.

14:20.902 --> 14:24.114
Are you saying you intend to keep writing
the sort of things I would never say?

14:24.197 --> 14:26.992
The sort of stuff that gives me the ick
and sets my teeth on edge?

14:31.663 --> 14:32.539
Are you crying?

14:32.622 --> 14:33.665
No, sir.

14:34.833 --> 14:37.252
I know I did wrong.

14:38.461 --> 14:42.090
But how can I delete it?
It's got more than 20,000 favorites.

14:43.842 --> 14:46.761
Anyone would think I'm the bad guy here.
I'm the victim!

14:47.387 --> 14:49.055
Of all the different genres,

14:50.765 --> 14:52.434
why did it have to be BL?

14:53.226 --> 14:57.480
Because the more I heard "No, no,"
the more I want to encourage them,

14:57.564 --> 15:01.276
and even just the slightest brush
of a fingertip creates a deep yearning.

15:03.486 --> 15:05.196
Do you even know what you did wrong?

15:05.864 --> 15:06.781
Yes, I do.

15:07.824 --> 15:08.908
I do know.

15:09.701 --> 15:12.787
But if you look at it from a more worldly
point-of-view, love is love.

15:12.871 --> 15:15.624
When two people love each other,
gender isn't that important.

15:15.707 --> 15:17.000
Not that.

15:18.460 --> 15:20.211
Not that?

15:20.295 --> 15:21.963
Then, the raunchiness?

15:22.047 --> 15:23.882
But it's not even rated 15.

15:23.965 --> 15:26.051
Even the publisher said it's mild.

15:26.134 --> 15:27.093
Mild!

15:28.970 --> 15:29.804
Not that either?

15:32.265 --> 15:34.267
Making my teachers the main characters?

15:34.351 --> 15:37.020
Yes, that was a huge mistake on my part.

15:37.103 --> 15:38.688
And I'm really sorry about that, but--

15:38.772 --> 15:40.565
You really are a lost cause.

15:43.276 --> 15:45.278
You still don't know what you did wrong.

15:45.362 --> 15:47.030
How can you not know?

15:47.113 --> 15:47.947
I'm sorry.

15:48.031 --> 15:49.157
I just don't get it.

15:50.867 --> 15:51.993
How is it?

15:52.952 --> 15:53.995
Why on earth…

15:56.289 --> 15:57.749
Am I not the main character?

16:01.294 --> 16:02.128
Sorry?

16:03.588 --> 16:06.007
You're going to have Dong-ju and Gi-jeon
end up together.

16:06.091 --> 16:07.133
Where does that leave me?

16:09.594 --> 16:11.096
You're a sub character.

16:12.430 --> 16:13.348
A sub.

16:15.934 --> 16:17.977
I've never been a sub my whole life.

16:19.854 --> 16:20.855
Sorry?

16:21.481 --> 16:22.857
I want you to rewrite it.

16:22.941 --> 16:24.109
With me

16:25.151 --> 16:26.027
as the main character.

16:28.571 --> 16:30.407
-What?
-You know what the main character is.

16:32.075 --> 16:34.035
You want to be the obsessive top?

16:36.287 --> 16:37.539
If that's the main character.

16:40.709 --> 16:42.669
Then the story will go off the rails.

16:42.752 --> 16:44.504
I don't care if it jumps the shark,

16:44.587 --> 16:46.798
just know that I'm going to check
each and every episode.

16:48.675 --> 16:51.761
Sir, you can't check it in advance.
I simply can't allow it.

16:53.471 --> 16:54.681
Why not?

16:54.764 --> 16:55.724
Well…

16:56.891 --> 16:59.894
If I know you're going to be reading,

16:59.978 --> 17:01.980
how can I write that kind of stuff?

17:02.063 --> 17:03.189
Then delete it.

17:12.615 --> 17:14.075
You have two choices.

17:14.159 --> 17:16.077
Delete it or let me check each episode.

17:16.161 --> 17:17.495
What are you going to do?

17:22.125 --> 17:23.293
I'll do it.

17:23.376 --> 17:24.961
I'll let you check it.

17:30.842 --> 17:32.010
What am I going to do?

17:44.898 --> 17:46.941
So he's mad, not because it's BL,

17:47.025 --> 17:49.736
but because he isn't the main character?

17:52.155 --> 17:54.157
He's not normal.

17:54.783 --> 17:57.243
He must be crazy.

17:57.327 --> 17:59.078
EBC FILMING PROPOSAL

17:59.162 --> 18:00.830
CHAPTER 21:
YOU REALLY THINK WOO-SU WILL DO IT?

18:02.916 --> 18:04.292
3. OBJECTIVE

18:06.085 --> 18:07.295
Come in.

18:08.630 --> 18:10.465
Do come in.

18:10.965 --> 18:12.342
Have a seat.

18:15.386 --> 18:16.262
Take a look.

18:19.599 --> 18:22.602
EBC is coming here to film?

18:22.685 --> 18:24.020
Finally.

18:24.103 --> 18:27.065
Next Monday,
the makers of that hit program

18:27.148 --> 18:30.068
are coming to film at our school.

18:33.404 --> 18:36.699
You four teachers
are the pride of our school.

18:36.783 --> 18:39.327
You're all elite teachers
with impressive resumes.

18:39.410 --> 18:44.582
When you're filmed teaching the kids
with your endless passion and dedication,

18:44.666 --> 18:48.336
the foundation's donors are sure
to start writing checks, right, Dong-ju?

18:48.419 --> 18:50.129
Sorry? Me?

18:50.213 --> 18:53.174
I want you to write an essay
setting out your philosophy of education.

18:53.258 --> 18:55.176
One that elicits emotion.

18:55.260 --> 18:57.512
Enough to make people cry.

18:58.513 --> 19:00.139
Yes, ma'am.

19:01.140 --> 19:02.517
And as for you, Gi-jeon.

19:02.600 --> 19:04.352
Prepare a few words about your path

19:04.435 --> 19:07.230
from retiring as a professional athlete
to become a teacher.

19:07.313 --> 19:09.440
Yes, ma'am.

19:09.524 --> 19:12.485
-Next, Da-ju.
-Yes.

19:12.569 --> 19:14.445
Do you think you can rehash

19:14.529 --> 19:16.865
your TUD talk?

19:16.948 --> 19:20.952
Your grand vision
is sure to go down in history.

19:21.536 --> 19:23.705
-Down in history.
-Down in history.

19:24.539 --> 19:27.417
And last but not least, Woo-su.

19:27.500 --> 19:29.669
What more needs to be said?

19:29.752 --> 19:32.171
You're the very definition
of a global elite.

19:32.255 --> 19:35.967
We just need to change your glasses.

19:37.093 --> 19:39.345
-And in class--
-I won't be taking part.

19:41.723 --> 19:42.932
Sorry?

19:45.184 --> 19:46.561
I don't want to film.

19:46.644 --> 19:49.397
But I'll cooperate in another way
if there's any.

19:50.607 --> 19:51.774
Woo-su.

19:53.401 --> 19:54.736
I guess you didn't hear me.

19:58.823 --> 20:00.950
This program will be on EBC.

20:01.534 --> 20:04.746
If you don't agree to film,

20:04.829 --> 20:06.497
that's going to be a problem.

20:07.081 --> 20:07.957
I'm sorry.

20:08.583 --> 20:09.584
That won't be possible.

20:12.253 --> 20:14.422
Still, for the sake of
the school's future development,

20:14.505 --> 20:16.382
please take some time to reconsider.

20:16.466 --> 20:18.092
I believe I've made myself clear.

20:18.176 --> 20:20.303
If you've nothing more to say,
I'll be on my way.

20:27.185 --> 20:28.603
Don't worry, Ms. Kim.

20:29.354 --> 20:30.688
I'll convince him.

20:31.397 --> 20:32.857
Da-ju.

20:34.484 --> 20:35.777
If you wouldn't mind.

20:36.903 --> 20:38.863
I want the four of you

20:38.947 --> 20:41.240
including Woo-su to be on camera.

20:42.533 --> 20:45.536
There's a week until filming,
I'm sure you can do it.

20:46.621 --> 20:48.206
-Yes.
-Of course.

20:48.790 --> 20:49.832
Don't worry.

20:56.339 --> 20:57.465
What are you going to do?

20:58.091 --> 20:59.258
Got any ideas?

21:00.343 --> 21:01.302
Of course, he doesn't.

21:02.512 --> 21:04.138
Couldn't just the three of us do it?

21:04.222 --> 21:06.307
You heard what the principal said.

21:07.767 --> 21:09.435
There's no point without Woo-su.

21:10.228 --> 21:13.314
We're basically Ga Woo-su and Boys.

21:13.898 --> 21:16.150
You really think Woo-su will do it?

21:16.234 --> 21:18.403
You know him better than anyone.

21:18.486 --> 21:20.321
Why did you say you'd convince him?

21:20.405 --> 21:22.156
At this school,

21:22.240 --> 21:25.368
upsetting the principal

21:25.451 --> 21:27.578
is a fate worse than death.

21:28.371 --> 21:29.539
If Woo-su won't film,

21:30.873 --> 21:32.208
we'll all end up being fired.

21:33.751 --> 21:35.003
No way.

21:36.713 --> 21:37.755
You think?

21:43.845 --> 21:46.097
Hey, Woo-su.

21:46.180 --> 21:47.098
Not doing it.

21:47.682 --> 21:48.975
Just this once.

21:49.058 --> 21:50.393
It'll be over in no time.

21:52.729 --> 21:54.022
How can you even say that?

21:54.105 --> 21:55.398
You of all people.

21:55.481 --> 21:56.983
You think I want to do this?

21:57.066 --> 21:59.277
I've known you since third grade.

21:59.902 --> 22:01.612
I know what happened better than anyone.

22:01.696 --> 22:03.322
Then don't make me say it again.

22:03.406 --> 22:04.240
Get out.

22:05.324 --> 22:07.577
Woo-su, don't make me
get down on my knees and beg.

22:07.660 --> 22:09.579
Don't bother. Now get out.

22:11.831 --> 22:12.707
Fine.

22:27.221 --> 22:28.097
WE WERE FRIENDS

22:34.645 --> 22:37.315
WE WERE FRIENDS, EPISODE 3

22:38.274 --> 22:40.068
When is she going to upload episode four?

22:42.779 --> 22:46.282
CHAPTER 22: DO I REALLY HAVE TO CHANGE
THIS FOR YOU TO FEEL VALIDATED?

22:46.866 --> 22:48.409
Now that he's going to check my work,

22:48.493 --> 22:51.162
how am I supposed to write
all the flirty stuff?

22:55.208 --> 22:57.001
I refuse to breathe
until we get episode four!

22:57.085 --> 22:58.836
Do you feel the tension between these two?

22:58.920 --> 23:00.630
Hurry up and upload episode four!

23:00.713 --> 23:02.715
When is episode four coming out?

23:26.322 --> 23:27.323
Where's episode four?

23:28.866 --> 23:31.494
Where's the "mass release"?
Have you lost your spark?

23:32.995 --> 23:33.955
I'm sorry, sir.

23:34.038 --> 23:35.540
There's no need to apologize to me.

23:36.958 --> 23:38.835
Try to understand how Si-on feels.

23:38.918 --> 23:40.461
What he likes and how he grew up.

23:40.545 --> 23:43.756
What he thinks about Yoon.

23:43.840 --> 23:45.466
Concentrate on Si-on.

23:58.229 --> 23:59.689
I hear EBC is gonna film at school.

23:59.772 --> 24:02.191
I hope Dong-ju doesn't become famous.

24:06.154 --> 24:07.446
Where are you going?

24:32.471 --> 24:33.431
MATHEMATICS

24:41.022 --> 24:43.858
Why do you get nervous and run away
every time you see Mr. Ga?

24:45.026 --> 24:46.485
Me?

24:46.569 --> 24:47.403
What do you mean?

24:48.029 --> 24:49.113
No, I don't.

24:54.660 --> 24:57.205
-Where did we get to?
-We're up to page 101.

24:57.288 --> 24:58.122
Page 101.

24:58.915 --> 25:00.625
Velocity and acceleration.

25:06.797 --> 25:08.299
He's so hardcore.

25:08.382 --> 25:10.843
How can he ride her like that
just for getting four points?

25:10.927 --> 25:12.220
A lot of kids gave up on math.

25:12.303 --> 25:14.305
But Eui-ju's the only one
that took the bait.

25:15.723 --> 25:18.643
It's not just the after-school class.
She seems to be really stressed.

25:26.734 --> 25:29.904
WE WERE FRIENDS, EPISODE 4

25:31.197 --> 25:35.034
THE DOOR TO THE PENTHOUSE OPENS
TO REVEAL A LONG CORRIDOR

25:37.453 --> 25:41.832
HIS HAND CLUTCHING THE STRAP ON HIS BAG,
YOON APPROACHES TAE-HA

25:41.916 --> 25:44.001
I told you not to be late.
Not even a second.

25:45.086 --> 25:45.920
I'm sorry.

25:46.420 --> 25:47.755
I ran here so as not to be late.

25:47.838 --> 25:49.257
Were you with Si-on?

25:50.341 --> 25:52.927
YOON COULDN'T BRING HIMSELF TO ANSWER

25:53.010 --> 25:55.179
HIS SILENCE WAS ENOUGH OF AN ANSWER

25:58.766 --> 25:59.725
This won't do.

26:00.351 --> 26:01.227
Choi Yoon.

26:02.520 --> 26:04.021
This place is huge.

26:04.105 --> 26:05.356
You live here alone?

26:07.233 --> 26:08.651
What about that ten million?

26:09.402 --> 26:11.404
Why are you being like this, Tae-ha?

26:12.697 --> 26:14.031
This isn't you.

26:16.826 --> 26:19.495
I'm not the same guy
who hung on your every word.

26:20.871 --> 26:23.291
I'm not the same guy
who ran to you like a puppy.

26:24.625 --> 26:25.584
Not anymore.

26:26.544 --> 26:27.837
Tae-ha.

26:27.920 --> 26:28.754
No.

26:30.923 --> 26:31.757
I could be

26:32.633 --> 26:33.509
your puppy.

26:34.885 --> 26:35.845
From now on,

26:36.846 --> 26:39.015
I'll be your personal bitch.

26:40.933 --> 26:43.477
FROM NOW ON, I'LL BE YOUR PERSONAL BITCH

26:48.816 --> 26:51.819
I made the right choice.

26:51.902 --> 26:53.571
This is better than deleting it.

26:54.363 --> 26:56.657
When faced with a difficult choice,

26:56.741 --> 26:58.659
taking the more difficult path

26:58.743 --> 27:00.161
is the way to salvation.

27:00.244 --> 27:02.830
No, I'm dying here.

27:16.719 --> 27:18.095
If it's the penthouse,

27:18.721 --> 27:20.473
shouldn't that be where Si-on lives?

27:21.515 --> 27:22.641
Sorry?

27:24.060 --> 27:24.894
What did I say?

27:26.520 --> 27:29.565
Si-on should be the main character.

27:29.648 --> 27:30.608
Again.

27:31.275 --> 27:33.402
Si-on should be the main character.

27:33.486 --> 27:34.487
Right. From now on,

27:34.570 --> 27:36.947
Si-on is the obsessive lead
and Tae-ha the regretful sub.

27:37.031 --> 27:39.950
Give all the key impactful lines to Si-on.

27:40.034 --> 27:41.744
Rewrite it with Tae-ha's role minimized.

27:46.499 --> 27:47.333
Now.

27:49.627 --> 27:50.961
Here?

27:52.963 --> 27:53.964
You've got one hour.

27:59.970 --> 28:00.846
Get away from him.

28:03.307 --> 28:04.225
What?

28:09.230 --> 28:11.357
It can't be helped
if you've got feelings for Tae-ha.

28:11.440 --> 28:13.150
But I won't stand idly by.

28:13.234 --> 28:14.151
From now on,

28:14.985 --> 28:17.613
I'll be your personal bitch.

28:21.659 --> 28:23.119
Hang on a second.

28:23.202 --> 28:24.078
This feels wrong.

28:27.373 --> 28:28.249
Sorry?

28:31.168 --> 28:33.087
What's wrong?

28:33.170 --> 28:36.006
Shouldn't this be Tae-ha's line?

28:40.177 --> 28:43.055
I know it feels a little awkward.

28:44.306 --> 28:45.474
Still, let's stick with it.

28:45.558 --> 28:48.477
Yoon needs to realize Si-on isn't the one.

28:48.561 --> 28:50.646
This isn't the first time
he's been gaslit.

28:51.272 --> 28:52.857
It's really frustrating.

28:52.940 --> 28:57.069
That needs to happen for Si-on to go
tumbling head over heels in misery.

28:57.153 --> 29:00.072
At this rate,
he won't even manage a single roly-poly.

29:00.156 --> 29:01.907
But, more than that,

29:03.159 --> 29:04.285
aren't I the lead character?

29:04.910 --> 29:07.371
Right now, Si-on is coming across
as the obsessive top.

29:11.500 --> 29:12.751
Not at all.

29:12.835 --> 29:15.838
No way. Of course not.

29:17.840 --> 29:20.342
It's just, as I was writing it,

29:20.426 --> 29:23.804
I felt like I should change
the flow of the narrative.

29:24.305 --> 29:26.307
In that way, how can I put it…

29:26.390 --> 29:28.976
The characters will go through
a wider range of emotions,

29:29.059 --> 29:31.187
and the story itself will be more diverse.

29:32.229 --> 29:33.230
But the thing is…

29:34.231 --> 29:35.232
Just a moment.

29:41.947 --> 29:44.783
Do I really have to change this
for you to feel validated?

29:55.419 --> 29:56.462
Fine.

29:57.379 --> 29:59.423
You're doing great.

29:59.507 --> 30:01.050
Fine, now if everybody

30:01.133 --> 30:03.177
can just hang in there!

30:04.178 --> 30:05.679
-Let's get back to it.
-Okay.

30:05.763 --> 30:07.640
-Let's do this.
-From the top.

30:07.723 --> 30:09.558
I'm fine with that.

30:10.726 --> 30:12.811
-We're doing this again?
-From now on,

30:13.771 --> 30:15.814
I'm going to be your personal bitch.

30:23.030 --> 30:24.198
Is this right?

30:24.281 --> 30:27.910
What the heck? I can't even write
my own novel how I want.

30:31.372 --> 30:32.498
Hang on.

30:33.499 --> 30:35.751
He's only checking the original file.

30:39.129 --> 30:40.589
That's much better.

30:40.673 --> 30:42.132
Really?

30:42.216 --> 30:43.050
Upload it.

30:55.354 --> 30:57.940
WE WERE FRIENDS
EPISODE 4 REAL

31:00.442 --> 31:01.277
EPISODE 4 REAL

31:01.944 --> 31:02.820
WE WERE FRIENDS

31:07.616 --> 31:08.576
SUBMIT A NEW PROJECT

31:11.620 --> 31:13.372
WE WERE FRIENDS, EPISODE 4

31:30.014 --> 31:33.434
There's no way he'll check online.

31:33.517 --> 31:35.060
Like he'd ever look up We Were Friends.

31:35.644 --> 31:36.770
-Not him.
-You little…

31:36.854 --> 31:38.063
Today's the day.

31:38.147 --> 31:39.315
Check your students' uniforms

31:39.398 --> 31:40.858
and make sure
they're on their best behavior.

31:40.941 --> 31:43.235
Let's make sure this is a success.

31:43.319 --> 31:45.112
-What's going on?
-Film him on the sly?

31:45.195 --> 31:46.905
I'll keep it a secret.

31:46.989 --> 31:48.073
I know everything.

31:48.157 --> 31:51.160
If you're not going to cooperate,
you leave me no choice.

31:51.243 --> 31:53.454
Why are you going this far?
You're going to regret this.

31:53.537 --> 31:55.205
Are you going to betray my trust?

31:55.289 --> 31:56.540
-I'll figure it out by myself.
-Try that, then.

31:56.624 --> 31:59.752
What am I going to do now, Mr. Ga?

31:59.835 --> 32:01.837
Shall I just transfer?

32:57.976 --> 32:59.978
Subtitle: Paul Carver
